om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100310/extras/1f5d7d07ee2fb5638e7f07047b17bed7.avif?t=1752574386\" data-has-big width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Jay Studio is co-financed by the European Fund for Modern Economy 2021-2027 as part of the KPT ScaleUp Booster project.</p>",
